<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed higher in heavy trading.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average rose 48.72 to 6526.07. It fell 214.52 points in the week.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite rose 3.62 to 398.02. It fell 9.41 in the week.</p>
<p>The average price per share was up $0.37.</p>
<p>Winners beat losers 1410 to 1046.</p>
<p>Volume was 537,236,660 compared with 495,468,750 on Thursday. Weekly volume was 2,598,876,660.</p>
<p>(Prices official as of 1645 EST/2045 GMT).</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
